    <title>EP12. 荀子在我心</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6628c3fc200abebe6ef83746</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6628c3fc200abebe6ef83746</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Apr 2024 08:34:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>你好哇！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>从小我们就伴着“人之初，性本善”的教导中长大，似乎“孟子”似的性善论观念成为某种统一。而荀子变成顺带提及的存在。</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么荀子会提出性恶论？什么是他定义的“恶”？他的理论是如何被王瀛昉重构的？对我们现在的生活又有什么意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span>敬请收听本期随谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>又及：椅子乐团是泽斌的心头爱，最终我们还是选择了它。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>今日推荐：</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.cuhk.edu.hk/chinese/" data-url="https://www.cuhk.edu.hk/chinese/"><span>香港中文大学</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1001911/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1001911/"><span>《灵魂饭》- 余华</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><strong><span>Shownotes：</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>王瀛昉：一套《荀子》式的恶的理论： 以礼义及“群居和一”为基础</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1034396/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1034396/"><span>《荀子集解》（中华书局新编诸子集成）</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/2567698/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/2567698/"><span>《三体》- 刘慈欣</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/34879939/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/34879939/"><span>《成神》- Michael Puett</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>[OP]</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>蛤蜊汤- Great balls of fire</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Music</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>椅子乐团- Shangri-La Is Calling</span></p><span></span><p><span>椅子乐团- 进入下一次新的梦之前</span></p><span></span><p><span>————</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：一坡（Mzero）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：李泽斌</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 收听方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在Apple Podcast, Spotify, 小宇宙等泛用型客户端收听我们的节目，也可以在网易云音乐，QQ音乐等app收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>还请大家多多评论！转发！收藏！这对我们有很大帮助！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的邮箱是：strollin_wall@outlook.com</span></p>]]></description>
