  <item>
    <title>EP11. 独立时代：诱人的平静</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661bf4e348c40e2fb0455474</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661bf4e348c40e2fb0455474</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Apr 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>你好哇！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>很庆幸自己的选择为一个普通的周六晚上赋予特殊的意义。在小船的邀请下，我们参加了《独立时代》的放映会。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这种感受是令人难忘的。似乎在那一刻，定义一部电影好坏的标准统统在真实又触动的感情下崩解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日推荐：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35633650/?dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35633650/?dt_dapp=1"><span>「坠落的审判」</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/21855881/?dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/21855881/?dt_dapp=1"><span>《荒野侦探》</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1304476/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1304476/"><span>「独立时代」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1291557/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1291557/"><span>「花样年华」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1296987/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1296987/"><span>「安妮·霍尔」 Annie Hall</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.academia.edu/610807/Quicker_Faster_Darker_Changes_in_Hollywood_Film_Over_75_Years" data-url="https://www.academia.edu/610807/Quicker_Faster_Darker_Changes_in_Hollywood_Film_Over_75_Years"><span>Quicker, Faster, Darker: Changes in Hollywood Film Over 75 Years</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1299661/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1299661/"><span>「苏州河」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/4908883/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/4908883/"><span>《荒原狼》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/heidegger/" data-url="https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/heidegger/"><span>海德格尔：此在（mitsein）</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1098789877" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1098789877"><span>上海的走廊_Official</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1G94y1L7uk/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=84b709cfa176d41f9ef6d349beecdcdd" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1G94y1L7uk/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=84b709cfa176d41f9ef6d349beecdcdd"><span>上海某哲学系禁烟宣传视频 | MasterClass of Smoking</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8A%9B%C2%B7%E7%9B%A7%E9%A6%AC" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8A%9B%C2%B7%E7%9B%A7%E9%A6%AC"><span>艾力·侯麥</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hk/%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E8%AE%BA" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hk/%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E8%AE%BA"><span>作者电影（Auteur theory）</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%9A%E7%9B%A7%C2%B7%E9%AB%98%E9%81%94" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%9A%E7%9B%A7%C2%B7%E9%AB%98%E9%81%94"><span>让-吕克·戈达尔</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1401588/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1401588/"><span>「法外之徒」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9F%8B%E7%B4%8D%C2%B7%E8%8D%B7%E7%B4%A2" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9F%8B%E7%B4%8D%C2%B7%E8%8D%B7%E7%B4%A2"><span>赫尔佐格</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/woodpushingmelon15?from=page_103505_profile&amp;wvr=6&amp;mod=like" data-url="https://weibo.com/woodpushingmelon15?from=page_103505_profile&amp;wvr=6&amp;mod=like"><span>木推瓜乐队</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://open.spotify.com/track/58Dzl41xZKPyE1EG9Zqbwk?si=5ee532a5b88a4d75" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/track/58Dzl41xZKPyE1EG9Zqbwk?si=5ee532a5b88a4d75"><span>罗大佑「小妹」</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><span>“抗拒那流言的困扰，那命运无情的怒潮”</span></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%94%A1%E7%90%B4" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%94%A1%E7%90%B4"><span>蔡琴</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.fountain.org.tw/interview/taiwan-music-1960s" data-url="https://www.fountain.org.tw/interview/taiwan-music-1960s"><span>傳統與跨界的前衛：1960年代台灣現代音樂與民歌採集運動</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://open.spotify.com/album/2kMM7jSaTTnpdeq6gFEPQW?si=FkvZ9UvaT32i4EWM52iilA" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/album/2kMM7jSaTTnpdeq6gFEPQW?si=FkvZ9UvaT32i4EWM52iilA"><span>罗大佑专辑「之乎者也」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9C%B7%E6%9D%91" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9C%B7%E6%9D%91"><span>眷村</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292329/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292329/"><span>「牯岭街少年杀人事件」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E5%B7%A5%E6%A8%82%E9%9A%8A" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E5%B7%A5%E6%A8%82%E9%9A%8A"><span>交工乐队</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E6%BF%83%E5%8F%8D%E6%B0%B4%E5%BA%AB%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%95" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E6%BF%83%E5%8F%8D%E6%B0%B4%E5%BA%AB%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%95"><span>美濃反水庫運動</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://open.spotify.com/album/7cza8SlxPnBBrf4Lw2dVUU?si=5zckRqp7Sy2bTOCR2qrx1w" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/album/7cza8SlxPnBBrf4Lw2dVUU?si=5zckRqp7Sy2bTOCR2qrx1w"><span>交工乐队专辑「菊花夜行军」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292679/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292679/"><span>「春光乍泄」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://manifiestos.infrarrealismo.com/primermanifiesto.html" data-url="https://manifiestos.infrarrealismo.com/primermanifiesto.html"><span>本能现实主义（具体详见《荒野侦探》）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>[OP]</span></p><span></span><p><span>蛤蜊汤- Great balls of fire</span></p><span></span><p><span>[ED]</span></p><span></span><p><span>罗大佑- 亚细亚的孤儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>————</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：一坡（Mzero）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：等小船</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：一坡</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 收听方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在Apple Podcast, Spotify, 小宇宙等泛用型客户端收听我们的节目，也可以在网易云音乐，QQ音乐等app收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>还请大家多多评论！转发！收藏！这对我们有很大帮助！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的邮箱是：strollin_wall@outlook.com</span></p>]]></description>
