    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>你好哇，</span></strong><span>这期是单聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为covid，没办法线下录制，线上又经历了一次音质事故······给本没有充足时间的高三生一记重锤。于是单聊将会成为未来一段时间的主流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是否有感受到居家后对于生活的割裂感？异化自我存在，丢失掌握时间的控制，处于焦虑与空虚的叠加态···我们应该如何跳出这样的漩涡？如何勇敢地做出改变？是什么运动让三千膝盖疼？是什么让Mzero痛心疾首，认为是对方的损失？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听本期节目！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#Shownotes#</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17e4y127XV/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17e4y127XV/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47"><span>无穷小亮的科普日常：吴定石种捕虫堇</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60909d14f3bdaa7a1cb85df8" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60909d14f3bdaa7a1cb85df8"><span>日知录：这是我和我家老鼠一起吃的粮食</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/637caa76882ce82fb6458c28" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/637caa76882ce82fb6458c28"><span>迟早更新：观鸟</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13t4y1T7W8/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13t4y1T7W8/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47"><span>他给钢琴装上轮子 把演奏会开在大马路上</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ig411Q7kH/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ig411Q7kH/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47"><span>我把毕业典礼 开到了纽约街头</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>｜Mzero</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案｜Mzero</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑｜Mzero</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐｜</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>蛤