  <item>
    <title>EP03. 【美丽新泡面】你难道不吃泡面吗？！！！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6333b0862a992d56e91e5183</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6333b0862a992d56e91e5183</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Sep 2022 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>你好哇！</span></strong><span>本期是关于速食品和校园生活的午后闲聊，跟随主播的脚步一起探寻校园生活吧！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>〔Talkers〕</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>三千 —东方树叶忠实粉丝</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mzero —吃雪糕肚肚疼的小猫猫</span></p><span></span><p><span>蛤喇汤 —梦想天天食泡面的泡面大师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>〔would hear〕</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a>怎样成为高素养主播（嗯？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a>是什么样惨无人绝的环境使得青葱岁月拥有一段丰富的泡面经历？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a>巨难吃的hc食堂？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a>且听蛤蜊汤老师讲述他与泡面的那些事</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a>三千师傅创造新吃法）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a>探访神秘的hc超市（生命之源）</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 旺仔广告）</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a>下水道里的章鱼）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a>住校生的奇妙体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3352">55:52</a>是什么薯片竟让Mzero一直被蒙骗？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a>到底为什么！？</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡面历史：</span><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/66919926/answer/247218706" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/question/66919926/answer/247218706"><span>www.zhihu.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>旺旺碎冰冰广告：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yi4y1x7kq?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yi4y1x7kq?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>〔OP〕</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>狗毛- 无病呻吟</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>〔ED〕</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>旺福- 爱你一兆年</span></p><span></span><p><span>———————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>文案| 三千</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑| Mzero</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在小宇宙app，网易云音乐，QQ音乐，podcast等泛用型客户端收听我们的节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>还请大家多多评论！转发！收藏！这对我们帮助会很大哦！！</span></p>]]></description>
