    <title>EP02. 【美丽新世界】在音乐中散步才是正经事哦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6327297caafc5c394512dee8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6327297caafc5c394512dee8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Sep 2022 14:21:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>你好哇！</span></strong><span>没有想到第三期差点没有出来！之后我们还是会保持偶尔冒出更新的习惯的！</span></p><p><span>[Talkers]</span><br><br><span>三千 —rai听一下音乐的糯米糍</span><br><br><span>Mzero —鼻炎和名词健忘症</span><br><br><span>蛤喇汤 —Gefimor Tang</span></p><p><span>[Time line]</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 小野丽莎 -Jambalaya</span></p><p><span>王若琳 -for no reason</span></p><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">18:32</a> 海龟先生 -恩典</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2188">36:28</a> 阿肆 -Get up, 若你爱上油麻地（顺便聊到mla）</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3148">52:28</a> 跟说唱散步？</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3533">58:53</a> 龙神道&amp;痛仰 -拥抱（unplugged）</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4696">1:18:16</a> 孙燕姿 -梦游</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5039">1:23:59</a> 福禄寿 -兰若度母</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5277">1:27:57</a> 颜培珊 -冷雨</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5705">1:35:05</a> 撒娇 -在劫难逃</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6325">1:45:25</a> 音乐杂谈</span></h2><h2><span>[ED]</span></h2><p><span>颜培珊 -小瓜</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhoPpjwYvqjooykJ9MMK4IR0RgQc.jpg"></figure><p><span>王若琳于高雄啤酒音乐节演唱龙的传人： </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Nx411W7YG?p=5&amp;share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Nx411W7YG?p=5&amp;share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmr4ESmcEpY6dmjRXBQt3EM64S2Y.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhvbMi5C7t5zxX7Ok0l5ERSGGrAk.jpg"></figure><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/628a565c4ba993cca0685e2a/6327297caafc5c394512dee8/www.zhihu.com" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/628a565c4ba993cca0685e2a/6327297caafc5c394512dee8/www.zhihu.com"><span>FigureVideo(有关海龟先生的介绍）</span></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FszP3P49_vyHfvVKNRzZE7KH83LW.jpg"></figure><p><span>Hayato：出生于日本冈山县，左小祖咒、海龟先生、残光乐队、打扰一下、新裤子乐队的鼓手。</span></p><p><span>海龟先生/薛凯琪 《咿呀呀》：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1G7411H74w?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1G7411H74w?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><p><span>复调：一種「多聲部音樂」。作品中含有兩條以上獨立旋律，通過技術性處理，和諧地結合在一起，這樣的音樂就叫做複音音樂。 複音音樂第一個「音」字表示旋律，中國音樂界習慣將「複音音樂」稱為「複調音樂」，主要是著眼於曲調一詞，但「複調音樂」容易與二十世紀的「複調性音樂」一詞混淆。（维基百科）</span></p><p><span>杉本博司：</span><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hiroshi_Sugimoto#" data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hiroshi_Sugimoto#"><span>en.wikipedia.org</span></a></p><p></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjAOykFX1K8hBwVqajmHnwkSgT_U.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkkahL3Ted1FAv4uspN0ZzMH4tCg.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnDrZbvsphTNx9VM_TSvk7ORZbLC.jpg"></figure><p><span>海龟先生《死不回头》: </span><a href="http://music.163.com/album/127256577/?userid=1816412162" data-url="http://music.163.com/album/127256577/?userid=1816412162"><span>music.163.com</span></a></p><p><span>阿肆《我在人民广场吃着炸鸡》： </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gY41157AG?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gY41157AG?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqUJmgwtbCA25ZTgbASH8TZ6BcVF.jpg"></figure><p><span>颜培珊</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FonfAuR3FKP8yZkESJUNiZ3AByfJ.jpg"></figure><p><span>小老虎《他在打水漂吗？》：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=28828014&amp;userid=1816412162" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=28828014&amp;userid=1816412162"><span>music.163.com</span></a></p><p><span>痛仰《不要停止我的音乐》：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/album?id=37797&amp;userid=1816412162" data-url="https://music.163.com/album?id=37797&amp;userid=1816412162"><span>music.163.com</span></a></p><p><span>痛仰《两个人的假期》：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=28949129&amp;userid=1816412162" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=28949129&amp;userid=1816412162"><span>music.163.com</span></a></p><p><span>田进勤（电子民乐器）：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18t411D77b?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18t411D77b?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><p><span>【双声道对比 痛仰乐队《太阳照常升起》和格莱美获奖作品《Something To Believe In》这两首歌到底有多像？】 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Y94y1d7qs?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Y94y1d7qs?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><p><span>福禄寿早期冰雪飞组合： </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Kk4y1U7Dz?p=2&amp;share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Kk4y1U7Dz?p=2&amp;share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=42bb0b9f69ede19c0cd2a59190075a47"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><p><span>——————————</span></p><p><span>#剪辑 Mzero</span></p><p><span>#收听方式#</span><br><br><span>你可以在小宇宙，网易云音乐，QQ音乐收听。</span><br><br><span>十分感谢大家的支持，欢迎大家在评论区积极讨论！</span></p>]]></description>
